Dialogue: 0,0:00:01.06,0:00:03.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Come on, we're shining, running, forever!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:04.08,0:00:06.76,Default,,0,0,0,,The sea is calling out, so ride the waves!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:06.94,0:00:09.56,Default,,0,0,0,,We're all together as one,\Nso let's sail in the sun!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:09.64,0:00:14.70,Default,,0,0,0,,All our dreams are never-ending, so\Nlet's wake up, wake up, wake up, wake up!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:14.94,0:00:17.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Heartbeat, we will be one! Go ahead!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:23.54,0:00:26.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Even though our hearts have\Ntraveled different paths.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:26.58,0:00:28.18,Default,,0,0,0,,We are best friends.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:28.26,0:00:30.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Our freedom is our only compass.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:30.10,0:00:34.20,Default,,0,0,0,,That's pointing us along the\Nmany roads that come together.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:34.28,0:00:37.52,Default,,0,0,0,,We will keep on running forward every day.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:37.60,0:00:38.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Go east, go west.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:38.94,0:00:41.66,Default,,0,0,0,,As long as we keep looking to the horizon.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:41.74,0:00:44.36,Default,,0,0,0,,We'll see everything all crystal clear.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:45.60,0:00:50.34,Default,,0,0,0,,We're all so thrilled that we\Ncan't wait until the dawn arrives.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:51.02,0:00:54.52,Default,,0,0,0,,So we'll just bring the\Nsun ourselves to know.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:54.60,0:00:58.74,Default,,0,0,0,,If the winds blow, we're waiting\Nwhere we should be going, go?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:59.64,0:01:02.20,Default,,0,0,0,,That's right. We're\Nshining, running forever.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:02.28,0:01:05.26,Default,,0,0,0,,All of our dreams will\Nmerge into one piece.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:05.34,0:01:07.98,Default,,0,0,0,,No matter where we go,\Nwe'll be fine and free.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:08.06,0:01:10.35,Default,,0,0,0,,Cause all our treasure is our strength.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:10.78,0:01:13.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Come on, we're shining, running forever.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:13.38,0:01:17.52,Default,,0,0,0,,The sea is coming out, so ride\Naway, we're all together as well.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:17.60,0:01:21.34,Default,,0,0,0,,So let's just stay with the sun,\Nwhile our dreams are never ending.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:21.42,0:01:26.96,Default,,0,0,0,,So let's wake up, wake up, wake up, wake\Nup, heartbeat, we will be one, go ahead.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:29.24,0:01:32.65,Default,,0,0,0,,My darkness will swallow the\Nworld, just you wait and see.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:33.34,0:01:35.00,Default,,0,0,0,,You think I'll lose to you?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:35.32,0:01:37.20,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm gonna be king of the pirates
Dialogue: 0,0:01:37.80,0:01:40.32,Default,,0,0,0,,Roger's treasure belongs to me
Dialogue: 0,0:01:44.44,0:01:47.64,Default,,0,0,0,,We'll ride non-stop and travel farther.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:47.72,0:01:52.28,Default,,0,0,0,,than we've ever gone And then tomorrow we
Dialogue: 0,0:01:52.36,0:01:55.36,Default,,0,0,0,,will find suspense And then commence to
Dialogue: 0,0:01:55.44,0:02:00.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Live out another day so intense.\NThat's right, we're shining,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:00.28,0:02:05.24,Default,,0,0,0,,Running forever. Let's go along\Nwith curiosity. Our feelings lead.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:05.32,0:02:10.94,Default,,0,0,0,,the way straight to a brand new day Into\Nanother adventure Come on, we're shining,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:11.24,0:02:16.72,Default,,0,0,0,,running forever. Open the map inside your\Nheart and see. No matter where we end up,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:16.82,0:02:22.22,Default,,0,0,0,,our mods will never give up There's a fire\Nin our dreams And you can never, never,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:22.46,0:02:25.86,Default,,0,0,0,,never, never stop it We\Nwill be one, go ahead!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:32.04,0:02:36.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Ricky lands a clean hit on\Nthe mighty Kiros! Actually,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:36.32,0:02:38.56,Default,,0,0,0,,this is the first time anyone has landed a
Dialogue: 0,0:02:38.64,0:02:41.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Clean hit on Kiros. In\Nhis entire tenure here!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:43.10,0:02:44.38,Default,,0,0,0,,And it's over!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:44.82,0:02:46.41,Default,,0,0,0,,Kyrus continues his streak!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:46.64,0:02:50.48,Default,,0,0,0,,Three thousand battles and three\Nthousand victories over nine years!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:50.56,0:02:51.80,Default,,0,0,0,,He's a living legend!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:52.08,0:02:56.12,Default,,0,0,0,,You might even say the word invincible\Nwas invented to describe this man!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:56.20,0:02:57.03,Default,,0,0,0,,Damn it.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:57.11,0:02:58.77,Default,,0,0,0,,You're the leader of this kingdom.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:58.86,0:03:00.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Rick, why?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:00.46,0:03:04.08,Default,,0,0,0,,I became quite strong after\Ntraining with you, didn't I?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:04.56,0:03:08.09,Default,,0,0,0,,But you lowered your guard as\Nsoon as you noticed it was me.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:08.78,0:03:11.20,Default,,0,0,0,,You're not such a beast after all.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:14.38,0:03:16.30,Default,,0,0,0,,You've punished yourself enough.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:16.56,0:03:18.52,Default,,0,0,0,,It's already been nine years.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:18.96,0:03:22.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Nearly a decade of your life\Nlocked away in this cage.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:24.86,0:03:28.70,Default,,0,0,0,,There's something important I\Nneed you to do on the outside.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:30.22,0:03:33.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Kiros, rather than regretting the\Nlives that you took in the past,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:33.62,0:03:36.80,Default,,0,0,0,,you should devote yourself to\Nsaving lives in the future.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:36.88,0:03:39.26,Default,,0,0,0,,I think you can find meaning in that.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:40.62,0:03:41.48,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes, sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:50.62,0:03:53.36,Default,,0,0,0,,We're counting on you, Kiros! Kiros!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:53.80,0:03:55.57,Default,,0,0,0,,Thanks for all your hard work!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:59.94,0:04:02.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Kiros, protect me!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:02.36,0:04:03.64,Default,,0,0,0,,We love you!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:04.58,0:04:07.56,Default,,0,0,0,,Captain Kiros, so popular with the ladies.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:07.90,0:04:10.55,Default,,0,0,0,,But I haven't forgotten\Nthat you're a killer.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:10.90,0:04:14.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Honestly, Father shouldn't\Nallow you inside the palace.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:14.28,0:04:15.88,Default,,0,0,0,,I object to it.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:16.06,0:04:17.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Please, Princess Scarlet.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:17.42,0:04:18.25,Default,,0,0,0,,That's cool.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:18.38,0:04:20.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Stop it digging up his old drama.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:20.52,0:04:25.00,Default,,0,0,0,,The captain of the guard is supposed to\Nbe a symbol of righteousness, not this.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:25.08,0:04:25.91,Default,,0,0,0,,Scarlet.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:26.20,0:04:29.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Even if you can fool the rest of\Nthe kingdom, you'll never fool me.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:30.06,0:04:32.34,Default,,0,0,0,,You'll show your true color soon enough.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:32.42,0:04:35.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't you dare lay a\Nfinger on me or my sister.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:35.10,0:04:37.34,Default,,0,0,0,,You keep your distance, understand?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:38.40,0:04:40.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Huh, I don't know.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:40.32,0:04:42.68,Default,,0,0,0,,He's not like that. Stop it.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:42.86,0:04:43.98,Default,,0,0,0,,You shouldn't look.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:44.06,0:04:45.98,Default,,0,0,0,,His mind's probably filthy.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:46.34,0:04:49.04,Default,,0,0,0,,But my job is to protect you.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:49.26,0:04:50.24,Default,,0,0,0,,No thanks.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:53.36,0:04:55.36,Default,,0,0,0,,Lady Scarlet has been kidnapped!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:55.68,0:04:56.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Curse those pirates!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:57.20,0:05:01.08,Default,,0,0,0,,What happened to her bodyguards?\NAll defeated! No way!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:01.62,0:05:02.80,Default,,0,0,0,,What do we do?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:10.80,0:05:12.45,Default,,0,0,0,,Forgive me for touching you.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:13.96,0:05:16.08,Default,,0,0,0,,I know you told me not to.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:19.00,0:05:22.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Kiros, I was so scared.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:23.14,0:05:25.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Forgive me! Forgive me!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:30.86,0:05:33.12,Default,,0,0,0,,I can't believe Scarlet is cooking.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:33.44,0:05:35.32,Default,,0,0,0,,I wonder what's gotten into her.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:48.14,0:05:49.26,Default,,0,0,0,,What did you say?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:49.52,0:05:51.99,Default,,0,0,0,,You want to resign as the royal bodyguard?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:52.64,0:05:55.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't tell me you've fallen\Nin love with Princess Scarlet.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:55.98,0:05:57.78,Default,,0,0,0,,With a beautiful princess like her?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:57.86,0:05:58.92,Default,,0,0,0,,No, I could never.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:59.02,0:06:01.44,Default,,0,0,0,,The people would certainly\Ncelebrate such a union.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:01.52,0:06:02.88,Default,,0,0,0,,In private, at least.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:03.12,0:06:06.44,Default,,0,0,0,,But because of your past,\Nit would be condemned.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:07.06,0:06:09.84,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm certain of it. We are royalty.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:10.28,0:06:11.40,Default,,0,0,0,,That is how it is.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:11.48,0:06:16.34,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't care father if I can't marry\Nhim I would rather die understand
Dialogue: 0,0:06:27.18,0:06:30.64,Default,,0,0,0,,Taken from us so yeah, I\Nhear it was a sudden illness.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:30.86,0:06:33.33,Default,,0,0,0,,She would have become a fine queen someday
Dialogue: 0,0:06:37.80,0:06:42.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Scarlet, as of today, you are no\Nlonger a member of the royal family.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:42.64,0:06:46.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Officially, you are not even\Nalive anymore. Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:48.10,0:06:51.08,Default,,0,0,0,,I fear I failed to repay your kindness.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:51.52,0:06:53.60,Default,,0,0,0,,You most certainly have, you lout.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:54.44,0:06:57.00,Default,,0,0,0,,But I'm more than happy to forgive you.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:57.46,0:07:00.56,Default,,0,0,0,,My boy, you've lived an amazing life.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:07.62,0:07:09.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Her name is Rebekah.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:10.72,0:07:12.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Kiros, she's your child.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:12.98,0:07:13.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Hold her.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:18.14,0:07:20.55,Default,,0,0,0,,I shouldn't touch such an innocent thing.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:20.68,0:07:22.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Not with these tainted hands.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:23.08,0:07:23.96,Default,,0,0,0,,It's not right.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:26.54,0:07:29.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Your father's a strange man. Sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:31.74,0:07:34.14,Default,,0,0,0,,You're such a little angel, aren't you?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:34.96,0:07:36.40,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll watch over you.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:36.62,0:07:38.38,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll always be at your side.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:41.14,0:07:41.97,Default,,0,0,0,,Hurrah!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:42.05,0:07:43.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Your grandpa is here.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:43.80,0:07:44.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Yay, Grandpa!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:45.14,0:07:47.73,Default,,0,0,0,,You've gotten as tall\Nas my palace, Rebecca.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:47.84,0:07:50.52,Default,,0,0,0,,Father, you can take off the disguise.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:51.70,0:07:53.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Kiros, gloves first. Gloves first.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:53.98,0:07:56.32,Default,,0,0,0,,My little girl, you're so cute.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:57.72,0:07:58.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Stop crying.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:13.04,0:08:15.30,Default,,0,0,0,,The royal palace, it's on fire.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:16.00,0:08:17.04,Default,,0,0,0,,What's going on?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:17.12,0:08:18.77,Default,,0,0,0,,Our kingdom's falling apart.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:19.08,0:08:20.46,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm going to the palace.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:20.54,0:08:23.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Scarlet, Rebecca, I need you\Nto stay safe. Okay, Daddy.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:24.22,0:08:26.24,Default,,0,0,0,,If it gets too dangerous here, leave.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:26.32,0:08:28.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Wait for me and the red flower field.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:28.72,0:08:30.80,Default,,0,0,0,,I swear I'll come back safe.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:37.04,0:08:37.94,Default,,0,0,0,,They've got me.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:41.60,0:08:42.96,Default,,0,0,0,,You filthy pirate.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:43.22,0:08:45.32,Default,,0,0,0,,What did you do? Let him go!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:45.78,0:08:48.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Rick here was the one\Nburning the kingdom down.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:48.50,0:08:49.33,Default,,0,0,0,,It wasn't me.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:50.14,0:08:52.32,Default,,0,0,0,,The king would never do such a thing.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:53.50,0:08:54.33,Default,,0,0,0,,Kiros!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:56.68,0:08:58.80,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't have any Devil Fruit powers.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:59.20,0:09:00.97,Default,,0,0,0,,Remove these shackles from me.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:01.94,0:09:04.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Listen, Kiros, I've heard\Ngood things about you.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:05.80,0:09:07.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Why not swear fealty to me?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:08.52,0:09:12.72,Default,,0,0,0,,The Rick bloodline will be\Nwiped out in no time at all.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:13.14,0:09:17.22,Default,,0,0,0,,And before you ask, that includes\Nyour dear wife and daughter as well.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:17.30,0:09:19.59,Default,,0,0,0,,I've already sent men to dispatch them.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:21.34,0:09:23.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Now you'll want to watch carefully.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:23.50,0:09:24.76,Default,,0,0,0,,You're witnessing history.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:24.84,0:09:27.68,Default,,0,0,0,,The final moments of the Rick dynasty.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:33.66,0:09:36.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Crazy bastard cut off his own leg.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:36.76,0:09:37.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Kirosu no!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:58.50,0:10:00.18,Default,,0,0,0,,That little guy's fast!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:00.42,0:10:02.02,Default,,0,0,0,,He made up of the old king!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:03.10,0:10:04.40,Default,,0,0,0,,This can't be real.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:04.66,0:10:05.62,Default,,0,0,0,,What happened?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:05.98,0:10:07.58,Default,,0,0,0,,I turned into a toy?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:14.32,0:10:15.15,Default,,0,0,0,,Sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:15.38,0:10:17.70,Default,,0,0,0,,I fear that name doesn't ring a bell.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:20.82,0:10:23.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Regardless, I'll never\Nforget what you did for me.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:23.78,0:10:24.94,Default,,0,0,0,,To a soldier.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:29.06,0:10:31.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Wait for me right where I told you.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:36.48,0:10:40.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Nobody knows my name—did the\Nwhole kingdom forget about me I?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:40.92,0:10:41.75,Default,,0,0,0,,Have
Dialogue: 0,0:10:47.56,0:10:50.10,Default,,0,0,0,,to get to the red flower field. Scarlett.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:58.96,0:11:00.36,Default,,0,0,0,,Scarlett.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:04.26,0:11:05.66,Default,,0,0,0,,It.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:12.00,0:11:13.74,Default,,0,0,0,,can't be!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:13.82,0:11:14.65,Default,,0,0,0,,be
Dialogue: 0,0:11:24.50,0:11:25.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Someone's been shot!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:26.10,0:11:27.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Is it Riku's army again?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:29.04,0:11:29.87,Default,,0,0,0,,Dammit!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:30.22,0:11:31.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Why did you wait for me?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:32.18,0:11:33.56,Default,,0,0,0,,Why are you here?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:38.86,0:11:40.32,Default,,0,0,0,,I see now.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:42.64,0:11:45.98,Default,,0,0,0,,It seems I've been erased\Nfrom everyone's memories.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:48.24,0:11:49.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Our promises.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:50.60,0:11:52.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Our time together.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:58.88,0:11:59.71,Default,,0,0,0,,Scarlet!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:02.68,0:12:03.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't die!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:04.12,0:12:05.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Hang on!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:05.52,0:12:06.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Can you hear me?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:07.22,0:12:08.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Please, say something!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:11.56,0:12:13.90,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll protect you! Say it with me!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:16.60,0:12:19.88,Default,,0,0,0,,I have a favor to ask of you, stranger.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:20.88,0:12:24.36,Default,,0,0,0,,Ranger, my daughter is hungry,\Nand she's waiting for me.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:27.04,0:12:27.87,Default,,0,0,0,,Please.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:28.18,0:12:29.02,Default,,0,0,0,,It's Kieros.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:29.22,0:12:30.22,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm your husband.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:30.50,0:12:31.54,Default,,0,0,0,,I beg you.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:39.74,0:12:40.57,Default,,0,0,0,,Scarlet.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:42.24,0:12:43.07,Default,,0,0,0,,Scarlet.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:49.88,0:12:50.71,Default,,0,0,0,,user
Dialogue: 0,0:12:51.70,0:12:52.53,Default,,0,0,0,,Scarlet!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:55.66,0:12:57.48,Default,,0,0,0,,How did it come to this?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:57.70,0:12:58.86,Default,,0,0,0,,I've lost her.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:59.10,0:13:00.00,Default,,0,0,0,,She's gone.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:00.36,0:13:01.54,Default,,0,0,0,,This is hell.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:02.56,0:13:04.94,Default,,0,0,0,,These useless tin arms of mine.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:05.28,0:13:08.96,Default,,0,0,0,,I can't even feel your\Nwarmth one last time.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:13.46,0:13:14.29,Default,,0,0,0,,Scarlet!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:24.56,0:13:25.39,Default,,0,0,0,,Soldier.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:26.96,0:13:27.79,Default,,0,0,0,,Soldier!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:28.96,0:13:30.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Are you all right?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:30.80,0:13:32.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes, it's nothing.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:32.92,0:13:34.76,Default,,0,0,0,,You having a bad dream or what?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:34.94,0:13:36.47,Default,,0,0,0,,Listen, we have a problem.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:36.68,0:13:38.50,Default,,0,0,0,,There are enemies on their way.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:43.06,0:13:43.89,Default,,0,0,0,,Unforgivable.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:44.08,0:13:46.61,Default,,0,0,0,,How dare he pretend to\Nbe the young master?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:47.22,0:13:50.36,Default,,0,0,0,,Straw Hat and his friends must\Nhave made it past the second floor.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:50.44,0:13:52.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Violet's blood was on the wall.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:52.24,0:13:53.07,Default,,0,0,0,,It's no good.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:54.64,0:13:57.29,Default,,0,0,0,,At this rate, we'll be\Ncompletely surrounded.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:57.72,0:14:01.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Is it better to make a surprise\Nattack on Doflamingo now?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:05.92,0:14:08.27,Default,,0,0,0,,Usaland and the others must have failed.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:10.18,0:14:13.94,Default,,0,0,0,,I was wondering, Straw Hat, are\Nall of your friends pirates?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:14.80,0:14:17.50,Default,,0,0,0,,I realize that Franky and New Zealand are.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:18.60,0:14:19.95,Default,,0,0,0,,That a problem for you?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:20.08,0:14:21.61,Default,,0,0,0,,No, I'm a criminal myself.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:22.10,0:14:24.81,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm just grateful that\Nwe share a common goal.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:32.86,0:14:35.32,Default,,0,0,0,,Those cracks in the ceiling\Nare freaking me out.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:35.40,0:14:37.18,Default,,0,0,0,,That's what happens when\Nyou have hundreds of
Dialogue: 0,0:14:37.26,0:14:39.76,Default,,0,0,0,,powerful fighters all\Ncompeting in the same event.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:39.84,0:14:42.58,Default,,0,0,0,,It's no surprise that the\Nstructure has taken so much damage.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:42.66,0:14:44.70,Default,,0,0,0,,That Burgess guy's out of control.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:44.98,0:14:48.82,Default,,0,0,0,,He's gonna bring the place\Ncrashing down and suck wave
Dialogue: 0,0:14:53.52,0:14:56.76,Default,,0,0,0,,Cut that out, stop shooting us.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:00.62,0:15:01.78,Default,,0,0,0,,You're funny.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:05.14,0:15:08.62,Default,,0,0,0,,If you don't believe me,\NI'll tell you again, Rebecca.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:08.70,0:15:12.58,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm the one who shot and\Nkilled your mother Scarlet.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:12.82,0:15:14.53,Default,,0,0,0,,I would have killed you, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:15.06,0:15:19.00,Default,,0,0,0,,My barrier only protects against\Nphysical attacks, not verbal ones.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:20.68,0:15:21.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Soldier... I...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:21.96,0:15:23.14,Default,,0,0,0,,I can't do it.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:24.80,0:15:26.14,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm so hungry.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:26.22,0:15:27.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Mother, I'm starving.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:27.98,0:15:30.02,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm going to bring us something to eat.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:30.10,0:15:30.93,Default,,0,0,0,,Really?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:33.54,0:15:35.52,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm too angry to even move.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:43.82,0:15:45.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Cyborg Freaky's down.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:45.46,0:15:46.96,Default,,0,0,0,,I think we're done here.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:48.66,0:15:50.64,Default,,0,0,0,,Usopp, I'm counting on you, bro.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:50.98,0:15:53.84,Default,,0,0,0,,I know you're going to start\Nthat riot any second now.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:53.92,0:15:54.86,Default,,0,0,0,,You've got this.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:56.60,0:15:57.64,Default,,0,0,0,,Usopp, go!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:57.72,0:15:58.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Usopp, go!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:58.96,0:16:00.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Usopp, go!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:05.04,0:16:07.51,Default,,0,0,0,,They're going nuts at the executive tower.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:07.62,0:16:10.22,Default,,0,0,0,,He said his name was\NUsopp of the Straw Hats?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:10.30,0:16:11.13,Default,,0,0,0,,Good luck.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:11.21,0:16:14.37,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't even know what you look like,\Nbut I'm cheering for you, Usopp.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:14.46,0:16:16.48,Default,,0,0,0,,He'll be my hero forever if you win.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:16.56,0:16:17.70,Default,,0,0,0,,You can do it.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:17.82,0:16:18.92,Default,,0,0,0,,You can do it.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:19.00,0:16:20.28,Default,,0,0,0,,Being a toy is awful.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:20.60,0:16:23.84,Default,,0,0,0,,If you can fix this, I promise I'll\Ngive up my grudge against Straw Hat.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:23.92,0:16:24.75,Default,,0,0,0,,Deal.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:24.83,0:16:26.49,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll be your flunky or whatever you want.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:26.58,0:16:27.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Just get this done.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:27.86,0:16:29.38,Default,,0,0,0,,You can have all of my money.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:29.46,0:16:31.08,Default,,0,0,0,,No price is too great!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:31.26,0:16:34.61,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, Treble, bring sugar to\Nthe palace and make it quick.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:35.54,0:16:37.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Take it easy, Toffee.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:37.72,0:16:41.72,Default,,0,0,0,,They tried to pull something, but\NI've got it all under control now.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:45.90,0:16:47.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Uzzelad, wake up!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:47.82,0:16:50.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Why don't you take this\Npoison grape of yours back?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:50.66,0:16:52.00,Default,,0,0,0,,That's our only hope!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:52.32,0:16:53.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Lutata babasco grape!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:55.02,0:16:56.88,Default,,0,0,0,,It's better if you eat it.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:57.52,0:16:58.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Drop dead, will you?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:04.34,0:17:05.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh
Dialogue: 0,0:17:30.44,0:17:31.70,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm dead, Sugar.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:32.16,0:17:33.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Everything's alright.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:33.50,0:17:35.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Please don't pass out on me, okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:40.30,0:17:41.13,Default,,0,0,0,,Look!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:41.21,0:17:42.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Hustle, I did it!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:43.02,0:17:45.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Sugar passed out!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:49.16,0:17:51.48,Default,,0,0,0,,Sugar passed out!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:01.86,0:18:03.36,Default,,0,0,0,,He did it!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:17.42,0:18:19.20,Default,,0,0,0,,They're growing big!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:19.78,0:18:22.52,Default,,0,0,0,,Some of them are growing really big!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:23.62,0:18:25.12,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm back!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:29.46,0:18:32.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Kinder, hey! Wake up! Hey!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:33.74,0:18:35.14,Default,,0,0,0,,It's a human!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:38.54,0:18:40.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Something's happening! What?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:41.14,0:18:43.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Those toys are acting rather strangely.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:44.78,0:18:46.00,Default,,0,0,0,,My body!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:48.46,0:18:49.29,Default,,0,0,0,,Who are you?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:52.34,0:18:54.18,Default,,0,0,0,,What's happening to me?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:56.28,0:18:57.76,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm human now!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:58.56,0:19:00.16,Default,,0,0,0,,I need that!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:09.48,0:19:10.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't be!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:10.66,0:19:11.56,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm sorry!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:12.12,0:19:12.98,Default,,0,0,0,,I goofed!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:13.08,0:19:14.24,Default,,0,0,0,,I goofed, Rupert!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:14.56,0:19:15.39,Default,,0,0,0,,You're trouble!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:15.47,0:19:16.34,Default,,0,0,0,,It's holding down!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:16.50,0:19:19.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Did something happen to Sugar? She...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:19.68,0:19:20.56,Default,,0,0,0,,she...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:20.64,0:19:22.24,Default,,0,0,0,,she passed out!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:22.46,0:19:24.40,Default,,0,0,0,,She got scared of pizza!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:28.24,0:19:31.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, this is supposed to\Nbe some kind of a joke.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:31.34,0:19:33.72,Default,,0,0,0,,The slaves we've been\Ncollecting for a whole
Dialogue: 0,0:19:33.80,0:19:36.21,Default,,0,0,0,,ten years are all turning back to normal.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:36.76,0:19:40.40,Default,,0,0,0,,The Hobby Hobby Fruits\Npowers are wearing off.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:40.74,0:19:42.12,Default,,0,0,0,,I remember now.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:42.40,0:19:43.56,Default,,0,0,0,,What's going on?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:43.76,0:19:45.58,Default,,0,0,0,,The toys in the Coliseum are...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:47.00,0:19:48.60,Default,,0,0,0,,What's going on here?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:48.90,0:19:50.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Look at the toys!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:50.36,0:19:52.28,Default,,0,0,0,,They're turning into humans!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:58.48,0:20:00.56,Default,,0,0,0,,Also animals, apparently!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:03.86,0:20:05.78,Default,,0,0,0,,They got her. Sugar!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:06.56,0:20:09.64,Default,,0,0,0,,We worked a whole decade\Nenslaving all of them!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:09.78,0:20:13.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Must have found Sugar and given\Nher a trouncing, huh? Pathetic.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:14.28,0:20:16.22,Default,,0,0,0,,That miserable pipsqueak.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:17.28,0:20:21.52,Default,,0,0,0,,But still, I sure hope she wasn't hurt.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:21.72,0:20:24.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Aw, you care about her, don't you?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:26.00,0:20:27.52,Default,,0,0,0,,Ellis, please answer!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:28.28,0:20:31.28,Default,,0,0,0,,Sir, all of these emergency\Nreports keep piling up!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:31.36,0:20:33.66,Default,,0,0,0,,We've got a different\Nway to that step here!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:33.74,0:20:37.15,Default,,0,0,0,,The toys working at the port\Nsuddenly turned into pirates!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:40.02,0:20:41.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, this is Carter here.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:42.02,0:20:44.90,Default,,0,0,0,,The toys, they turned into\Ndress-wasted soldiers!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:45.06,0:20:48.96,Default,,0,0,0,,They turned into government officials,\Nmarines, and foreign royalty!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:49.04,0:20:50.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Wild animals!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:50.68,0:20:52.68,Default,,0,0,0,,They're in the Primalist district!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:54.40,0:20:55.56,Default,,0,0,0,,I can't help!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:02.42,0:21:03.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Hang in there.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:04.54,0:21:05.37,Default,,0,0,0,,Usaland!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:06.48,0:21:07.31,Default,,0,0,0,,Usaland!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:08.40,0:21:12.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Me and everyone else, we all\Nbecame human again thanks to you!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:13.38,0:21:15.42,Default,,0,0,0,,You did it, Usaland!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:15.94,0:21:19.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Operation SOP is a success thanks to you!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:22.14,0:21:26.74,Default,,0,0,0,,All the people you saved,\Nthey're smiling and cheering.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:28.04,0:21:29.64,Default,,0,0,0,,What's wrong, Winpoko?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:30.02,0:21:32.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Mom, my toy is acting real weird.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:36.18,0:21:37.01,Default,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:37.62,0:21:39.24,Default,,0,0,0,,Winpoko? Hold on.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:39.74,0:21:41.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Are you...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:42.22,0:21:43.30,Default,,0,0,0,,But how?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:43.50,0:21:45.30,Default,,0,0,0,,My darling, is that you?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:47.38,0:21:49.42,Default,,0,0,0,,I turned back.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:49.58,0:21:50.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Honey!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:50.94,0:21:52.76,Default,,0,0,0,,Dad, you're not Wapol!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:53.42,0:21:55.58,Default,,0,0,0,,That's right, finally! Daddy!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:57.32,0:21:58.68,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't understand.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:59.10,0:22:01.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Why have we forgotten\Nabout you all this time?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:01.82,0:22:03.66,Default,,0,0,0,,That's how the power works.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:03.90,0:22:05.92,Default,,0,0,0,,I thought I'd be a toy forever.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:08.68,0:22:12.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, Daddy, can you lift me\Nup high? Uh-huh. Like this?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:21.40,0:22:22.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Damn it!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:22.42,0:22:23.77,Default,,0,0,0,,Gone quiet on me again?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:23.94,0:22:26.41,Default,,0,0,0,,Where'd you run off to, you stone bastard?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:31.12,0:22:32.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Come look!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:40.00,0:22:41.70,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm not dead yet.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:41.86,0:22:44.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Our hero's alive after all!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:46.74,0:22:47.92,Default,,0,0,0,,He's scared me.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:48.00,0:22:49.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Thanks, Usalind!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:49.28,0:22:51.28,Default,,0,0,0,,I never stop believing in you!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:57.28,0:23:00.32,Default,,0,0,0,,Everything went according to plan.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:00.66,0:23:02.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Just so cool!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:05.68,0:23:09.94,Default,,0,0,0,,And don't worry, you can\Nleave the rest to my friends.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:10.34,0:23:13.54,Default,,0,0,0,,The real battle has just begun.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:15.42,0:23:16.25,Default,,0,0,0,,Okay!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:21.90,0:23:22.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Rise up!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:22.94,0:23:24.64,Default,,0,0,0,,Take down Doflamingo!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:24.76,0:23:27.52,Default,,0,0,0,,I can't believe that Rotten King\Ntricked us for all these years!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:27.60,0:23:28.56,Default,,0,0,0,,You've lost it.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:28.74,0:23:29.86,Default,,0,0,0,,He's a fine leader.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:30.08,0:23:32.90,Default,,0,0,0,,We only thought that\Nbecause he heard the truth.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:33.16,0:23:34.18,Default,,0,0,0,,He's really...
Dialogue: 0,0:23:34.26,0:23:35.18,Default,,0,0,0,,a demon.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:35.66,0:23:37.74,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll have your head, Doflamingo!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:39.30,0:23:40.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Get out here and fight!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:41.12,0:23:44.50,Default,,0,0,0,,I've got ten years of suffering\NI need to pay you back for!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:44.58,0:23:47.24,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, Isha, any clue what's happening?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:48.00,0:23:50.66,Default,,0,0,0,,It would appear that\Nthe tides have turned.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:52.52,0:23:54.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Despite all appearances,
Dialogue: 0,0:23:54.70,0:23:58.58,Default,,0,0,0,,there is a deep darkness here,\Nmuch deeper than I had anticipated.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:59.26,0:24:01.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Go to hell, Doflamingo!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:43.54,0:24:45.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Who's the cape guy?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:45.46,0:24:47.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Kaidou, it's you! Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:47.42,0:24:49.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Even I lost my memories of him.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:51.24,0:24:52.28,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't get it.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:52.42,0:24:53.42,Default,,0,0,0,,What do you mean?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:54.16,0:24:55.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, where's the soldier?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:56.12,0:24:57.30,Default,,0,0,0,,That man is him.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:57.72,0:24:58.86,Default,,0,0,0,,How's that work?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:59.28,0:25:01.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Originally, the toys were human like us.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:01.90,0:25:05.08,Default,,0,0,0,,When they changed, they were\Nerased from our memories.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:05.28,0:25:08.10,Default,,0,0,0,,The girl who did this\Nsugar passed out just now.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:08.28,0:25:10.57,Default,,0,0,0,,So our memories all came flooding back.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:15.38,0:25:18.82,Default,,0,0,0,,He's the former captain of\NKing Riku's army, Karoo!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:22.82,0:25:26.06,Default,,0,0,0,,The strongest gladiator in\Nthe history of the Coliseum!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:26.98,0:25:29.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Wait, the guy they have the statue of?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:29.30,0:25:34.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes, but more than that, he's my\Nbrother-in-law, Rebecca's father!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:36.06,0:25:38.30,Default,,0,0,0,,But she said she didn't know that guy!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:38.86,0:25:43.28,Default,,0,0,0,,Once our memories are lost, they can't\Nbe regained till Sugar is stopped.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:44.18,0:25:48.32,Default,,0,0,0,,Even so, he's watched over his\Ndaughter for the past ten years.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:58.56,0:26:01.21,Default,,0,0,0,,Even though he was only\Na toy soldier to her,
Dialogue: 0,0:26:01.42,0:26:05.34,Default,,0,0,0,,he stayed by her side every day,\Nprotecting her the best he could.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:14.04,0:26:15.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, who goes there?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:20.72,0:26:23.98,Default,,0,0,0,,It's you, Karoo, my boy. Sir!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:26.56,0:26:30.70,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm sorry to keep you waiting\Nthese ten long years, King Rick.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:31.42,0:26:34.62,Default,,0,0,0,,But now, I'm here to save you!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:53.50,0:26:57.46,Default,,0,0,0,,We shall reclaim this\Nkingdom at long last!
Dialogue: 0,0:27:09.00,0:27:10.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Ten years.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:11.88,0:27:15.44,Default,,0,0,0,,For ten long years, we've suffered.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:16.04,0:27:16.87,Default,,0,0,0,,Hmm.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:18.74,0:27:19.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Toe Flamingo!
Dialogue: 0,0:27:19.94,0:27:20.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Yog-master!
Dialogue: 0,0:27:22.26,0:27:23.38,Default,,0,0,0,,You've been dead!
Dialogue: 0,0:27:27.90,0:27:29.28,Default,,0,0,0,,Mingo just died!
Dialogue: 0,0:27:29.48,0:27:30.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, that sucks.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:30.54,0:27:32.28,Default,,0,0,0,,I was gonna be the one to kick his ass.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:32.36,0:27:33.19,Default,,0,0,0,,There they are!
Dialogue: 0,0:27:33.27,0:27:34.10,Default,,0,0,0,,I see ya!
Dialogue: 0,0:27:34.19,0:27:35.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Get there!
Dialogue: 0,0:27:35.10,0:27:35.93,Default,,0,0,0,,They found us.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:36.76,0:27:38.74,Default,,0,0,0,,We've got to go save Traffy!
Dialogue: 0,0:27:39.98,0:27:42.82,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't even know how to explain this!
Dialogue: 0,0:27:43.06,0:27:44.20,Default,,0,0,0,,It's inconceivable!
Dialogue: 0,0:27:48.44,0:27:51.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Where the hell did this\Ngorilla come from? Run!
Dialogue: 0,0:27:54.18,0:27:56.54,Default,,0,0,0,,I can't believe this.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:57.26,0:27:58.09,Default,,0,0,0,,Shrebel.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:58.58,0:28:00.76,Default,,0,0,0,,Left sugar unguarded?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:01.06,0:28:03.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, I'm not your babysitter.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:03.44,0:28:04.64,Default,,0,0,0,,Stop your bawling.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:05.14,0:28:06.38,Default,,0,0,0,,It's not like that.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:09.00,0:28:09.88,Default,,0,0,0,,I had...
Dialogue: 0,0:28:10.48,0:28:11.94,Default,,0,0,0,,I had a father.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:14.28,0:28:18.75,Default,,0,0,0,,Now that the smoke is clear, it's time\Nwe uncover the truth, right, Rebecca?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:21.42,0:28:23.89,Default,,0,0,0,,There's a core at the heart of all things.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:25.08,0:28:26.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Once you find that...
Dialogue: 0,0:28:26.62,0:28:27.60,Default,,0,0,0,,You lost me!
Dialogue: 0,0:28:27.76,0:28:30.30,Default,,0,0,0,,You sound cool as hell, and I\Nstill look up to you, of course.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:30.38,0:28:31.98,Default,,0,0,0,,but, uh, you lost me!
Dialogue: 0,0:28:32.94,0:28:36.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Even the ring we stand in now has a core.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:39.26,0:28:42.48,Default,,0,0,0,,I think it's about time we wrap this up.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:52.32,0:28:53.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Dragon Claw Fist?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:57.20,0:28:58.03,Default,,0,0,0,,Dragon!
Dialogue: 0,0:29:09.56,0:29:15.32,Default,,0,0,0,,Unbelievable that was a single blow\Nfrom Lucy. The ring's going under.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:16.38,0:29:18.44,Default,,0,0,0,,The whole ring has exploded.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:23.22,0:29:27.38,Default,,0,0,0,,That's great. What the hell did you do?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:27.46,0:29:29.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Got places to be?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:29.26,0:29:30.48,Default,,0,0,0,,Need to win!
Dialogue: 0,0:29:35.16,0:29:37.04,Default,,0,0,0,,What's a lot commotion up there?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:37.32,0:29:38.15,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, Hawk.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:38.52,0:29:40.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Did he do something reckless again?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:41.68,0:29:43.39,Default,,0,0,0,,He's heading underground now.
